{"seq":3,"slug":"look-at-aim","title":"注视与瞄准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/ik/look-at-aim","wordCount":1706,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"注视与瞄准\">注视与瞄准</h1><p>NPC 全程目视前方、玩家从他身旁走过他眼皮都不抬一下——这种「死鱼眼」是廉价感的来源之一。让角色的头、眼睛、上半身转向它该关注的东西（玩家、敌人、交互物），是程序化动画里性价比极高的一项：实现不难，但对「角色是否活着」的观感提升巨大。瞄准（aim）是它的孪生需求——让武器、炮塔精确指向准星命中点。两者数学同源，难点都不在「转向目标」本身，而在<strong>把旋转合理地分摊到一串骨骼上</strong>并加约束防止扭断脖子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>注视/瞄准的本质：给定一根（或一串）骨骼，让它的「前方轴」对准世界空间里的一个目标点。最简单的形式是单骨 LookAt——算出从骨骼指向目标的方向，构造一个把骨骼前向轴旋到该方向的旋转，写回姿态。但单骨 LookAt 用在脖子上会让头「硬生生」地杵向目标，僵硬且常超出生理极限。真实的注视是<strong>头转一点、脖子转一点、上脊椎也转一点</strong>，由多节骨骼协同完成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[目标世界坐标&lt;br/&gt;玩家/敌人/准星点] --&gt; B[计算期望朝向]&#10;  B --&gt; C[沿骨链分摊旋转&lt;br/&gt;脊椎 脖子 头 各担一部分]&#10;  C --&gt; D[逐骨夹紧角度限制&lt;br/&gt;不超生理/机械极限]&#10;  D --&gt; E{目标在视野内?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[平滑插值到目标朝向]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[停在极限或回正]&#10;  F --&gt; H[写回姿态]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[目标世界坐标&lt;br/&gt;玩家/敌人/准星点] --&gt; B[计算期望朝向]\n  B --&gt; C[沿骨链分摊旋转&lt;br/&gt;脊椎 脖子 头 各担一部分]\n  C --&gt; D[逐骨夹紧角度限制&lt;br/&gt;不超生理/机械极限]\n  D --&gt; E{目标在视野内?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[平滑插值到目标朝向]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[停在极限或回正]\n  F --&gt; H[写回姿态]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>下表对比注视与瞄准这对孪生需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>注视 LookAt</th>\n<th>瞄准 Aim</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>驱动目标</td>\n<td>玩家/敌人/兴趣点</td>\n<td>准星命中点/锁定敌人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>涉及骨骼</td>\n<td>眼、头、脖、上脊椎</td>\n<td>脊椎、肩、武器骨/炮塔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度要求</td>\n<td>低（像就行）</td>\n<td>高（子弹要打中）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键约束</td>\n<td>生理角度限制</td>\n<td>机械极限 + 不穿模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败表现</td>\n<td>脖子拧断、抖动</td>\n<td>弹道偏、武器抽搐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把旋转分摊到骨链-避免拧断脖子\">把旋转分摊到骨链：避免拧断脖子</h2><p>注视看起来真实的秘诀是分摊。设目标相对角色需要总转向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把它按权重分配给参与的骨骼：上脊椎担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、脖子担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、头担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1 + w_2 + w_3 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（典型如 0.3 / 0.3 / 0.4，头担最多）。每根骨骼各转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i \\cdot \\theta_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，叠加起来既到位又自然。眼睛可在头之上再补一层细微转动，做「眼神先于头部」的灵动感。</p>\n<p>光分摊还不够，必须<strong>逐骨夹紧角度限制（clamp）</strong>。人的脖子转不过约 ±70°、上下俯仰也有限。对每根骨骼，把它要转的角度夹进允许范围（yaw、pitch 各自的上下限），超出的部分要么留给下一根骨骼、要么干脆放弃（目标在身后就别强行回头）。不夹限的后果就是经典 bug——「头转 180° 拧断脖子」「林登贝尔脖」。Unreal 的 Look At / Aim 节点、Unity Animation Rigging 的 Multi-Aim Constraint 都内置了 yaw/pitch 限制与轴配置，正是为此。</p>\n<p>夹限还要处理「死区与回正」：目标移到角色视野背后（超出所有骨骼累计极限）时，不该硬卡在极限角度发抖，而应平滑地回正（转回默认朝向）或停在最大舒适角，等目标重新进入视野再跟上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平滑-注视要-跟-不要-瞬移\">平滑：注视要「跟」不要「瞬移」</h2><p>注视最忌讳瞬间锁定。目标每帧位置略有抖动（玩家走路晃动、敌人换了一个），若头每帧硬锁到目标，会高频抖动；目标突然切换（看向新敌人）时若瞬移，会像被电击。两者都靠平滑解决。</p>\n<p>常用是对<strong>朝向</strong>做插值而非对目标点。每帧把当前朝向用球面插值（slerp）朝期望朝向靠近：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_t = \\mathrm{slerp}(q_{t-1},\\ q_{\\text{target}},\\ 1 - e^{-k\\,\\Delta t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">slerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是跟随速度（越大跟得越紧），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - e^{-k\\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是与帧率无关的平滑系数（比直接用固定 lerp 系数更稳，掉帧时不会跟得忽快忽慢）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就是一个核心手感参数：太小则注视「迟钝」（目标都走远了头才慢慢转过去），太大则「机械」（像被磁铁吸住）。怎么调它见<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>。</p>\n<p>注视权重还该随情境淡入淡出：进入对话区淡入到 1，离开淡出到 0；攻击动画播放时也许该临时压低注视权重，别让它抢走攻击的表演。这种权重择时由动画通知驱动，机制同<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瞄准-精度优先的特例\">瞄准：精度优先的特例</h2><p>瞄准是注视的「高精度版」。让角色的枪口指向准星命中点，子弹要真的从枪口飞向那里，所以末端朝向的精度要求远高于注视——差一点点，远处就脱靶。</p>\n<p>几个瞄准特有的工程点。其一，<strong>枪口对齐而非骨骼对齐</strong>：要对齐的是武器的「枪管轴」，它通常不是某根骨骼的本地轴，需要先把武器/手骨的当前枪口朝向算准，再求到目标的旋转差。其二，<strong>上半身瞄准偏移（aim offset）常与混合配合</strong>：很多 FPS/TPS 用一组朝不同方向瞄准的姿态（aim offset），按准星的 yaw/pitch 在它们之间混合（这属于动画混合，见<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/blend-trees\">动画系统的混合</a>），再叠加 IK 做最后精修，纯 IK 与混合各有所长。其三，<strong>炮塔/机械臂瞄准</strong>则是纯 IK 问题且常带机械极限（炮管俯仰范围、转台速度上限），用 CCD 或 FABRIK 沿机械链求解（见<a href=\"ik-solvers\">IK 求解器</a>），并严格限速——炮塔不能瞬间转向，要受角速度上限约束，这也带来了「索敌-转向-开火」的玩法节奏。</p>\n<p>瞄准还要防穿模：上半身大角度后仰瞄高处时，武器或手臂可能插进身体，需加偏移或二次约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>注视/瞄准本质是「让骨骼前向轴对准世界目标点」；单骨 LookAt 僵硬，真实注视要把旋转分摊到眼-头-脖-上脊椎多骨协同。</li>\n<li>分摊后必须逐骨夹紧角度限制，否则会「拧断脖子」；目标移到视野背后要平滑回正而非卡在极限发抖。</li>\n<li>平滑用对朝向做 slerp，系数取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-e^{-k\\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（帧率无关）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心手感参数，太小迟钝、太大机械。</li>\n<li>瞄准是高精度特例：对齐的是武器枪口轴非骨骼轴，常与 aim offset 混合配合 IK 精修；炮塔/机械臂瞄准带机械极限与角速度上限。</li>\n<li>注视/瞄准权重应随情境（对话、攻击）淡入淡出，由动画通知择时，别抢走表演。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"ik-solvers\">IK 求解器</a>（瞄准机械链所用的 CCD/FABRIK）、<a href=\"foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>（IK 的另一大应用）、<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>（跟随速度等参数怎么调）、<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>（注视权重的择时）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/blend-trees\">动画系统 — Blend Tree</a>（aim offset 姿态混合，与本篇 IK 精修互补）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Look At / Multi-Aim 约束特性参考 Unity Animation Rigging 文档（docs.unity3d.com）与 Epic Control Rig Aim 节点文档（dev.epicgames.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"注视与瞄准","id":"注视与瞄准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"把旋转分摊到骨链：避免拧断脖子","id":"把旋转分摊到骨链-避免拧断脖子"},{"level":2,"text":"平滑：注视要「跟」不要「瞬移」","id":"平滑-注视要-跟-不要-瞬移"},{"level":2,"text":"瞄准：精度优先的特例","id":"瞄准-精度优先的特例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"足部贴地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/ik/foot-placement"},"next":{"title":"二级动态与弹簧骨","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/secondary-motion"}}